<section
  class="wrap grid grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] items-center gap-[60px] pb-[100px] pt-[190px] max-[900px]:grid-cols-1 max-[900px]:pt-[150px]"
>
  <div>
    <div class="eyebrow">MAKEUP &amp; HAIR ARTIST</div>
    <h1 class="mb-[26px] text-[clamp(38px,5.6vw,64px)] font-normal leading-[1.28]">
      讓每一次上妝，<br />成為妳的高光時刻
    </h1>
    <p class="mb-10 max-w-[38ch] text-[17px] text-ink-soft">
      Hanna 專注於婚禮、時尚棚拍與個人形象妝造，擅長以細膩的色彩層次，勾勒出屬於每個人的自然氣色。
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a href="#portfolio" class="btn btn-primary">查看作品集</a>
      <a href="#booking" class="btn btn-ghost">預約諮詢</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto aspect-square max-w-[420px]" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="pan w-[46%] h-[46%] top-[2%] left-[8%] bg-rose-soft [animation-delay:0.05s]"></div>
    <div class="pan w-[34%] h-[34%] top-[6%] left-[58%] bg-coffee [animation-delay:0.18s]"></div>
    <div class="pan w-[30%] h-[30%] top-[44%] left-[2%] bg-stone [animation-delay:0.3s]"></div>
    <div class="pan w-[40%] h-[40%] top-[38%] left-[34%] bg-rose [animation-delay:0.42s]"></div>
    <div class="pan w-[26%] h-[26%] top-[60%] left-[76%] bg-wisteria-soft [animation-delay:0.5s]"></div>
    <div class="pan w-[22%] h-[22%] top-[78%] left-[14%] bg-cream [animation-delay:0.6s]"></div>
    <div class="pan w-[30%] h-[30%] top-[70%] left-[42%] bg-green [animation-delay:0.7s]"></div>
    <div class="pan w-[20%] h-[20%] top-[14%] left-[38%] bg-camel [animation-delay:0.8s]"></div>
  </div>
</section>
